# Header rules for Workers static assets (wrangler `assets` binding).
# These paths are served straight from the edge BEFORE the worker runs,
# so this file is the only place their response headers can be set.
#
# Everything listed here is referenced ONLY with a ?v=<LAB_V> cache-buster
# (src/lib/labVersion.ts) and the lab files never reference each other
# without it — so the content behind a given URL never changes and
# `immutable` is safe. A LAB_V bump ships changes under a brand-new URL.
#
# Do NOT add paths that are referenced without ?v= — e.g. /lab/shots/*,
# /vdt-glass-logo.png — those must stay revalidatable or an image swap
# would be invisible for a year.

/lab/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/lab/contact-card.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/lab/contact-card.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
